{"step_index":825,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-13T14:58:37Z","input_tokens":3927,"cache_read_tokens":197079,"output_tokens":1743,"content":"Aha! Kalau menggunakan **Dokploy**, error 502 itu **sangat wajar dan mudah diselesaikan**. \n\nDi Dokploy (mirip Vercel/Coolify berbasis Docker), error 502 hampir selalu disebabkan oleh **salah satu dari 2 hal ini**:\n1. **Port belum diubah ke `3000`** (Dokploy defaultnya seringkali port `80`, sedangkan Next.js berjalan di port `3000`).\n2. **Aplikasi belum selesai di-Deploy** atau gagal saat build karena variabel `.env` belum dimasukkan.\n\n---\n\n### 📋 Panduan Setup di Dashboard Dokploy (Langkah Cepat):\n\nSilakan login ke dashboard Dokploy yang diberikan panitia, lalu ikuti langkah ini:\n\n#### 1. Masuk ke Aplikasi Anda\n- Buka menu **Projects** → pilih aplikasi Anda (misal namanya `codekids` atau `peserta39`).\n\n---\n\n#### 2. Atur Port ke `3000` (Penyebab Utama 502) ⚠️\n- Masuk ke tab **General** (atau tab **Domains / Network** tergantung versi Dokploy).\n- Cari kolom **Port** / **Container Port**.\n- Ubah angkanya menjadi: **`3000`**.\n- Simpan (*Save*).\n\n---\n\n#### 3. Masukkan Environment Variables\n- Masuk ke tab **Environment** (atau **Environment Variables**).\n- Salin dan tempelkan variabel berikut:\n\n```env\nDATABASE_URL=\"file:./dev.db\"\nAUTH_SECRET=\"dev-only-secret-change-me-0123456789abcdef\"\nGEMINI_API_KEY=\"REDACTED_GEMINI_API_KEY\"\nGEMINI_MODEL=\"gemini-3.5-flash\"\nEMAIL_USER=\"muhammadbaihaqi1401@gmail.com\"\nEMAIL_PASS=\"REDACTED_EMAIL_PASS\"\nNEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL=\"https://peserta39.m1sec.my.id\"\n```\n*(Perhatikan `NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL` sudah disesuaikan dengan domain Anda: `https://peserta39.m1sec.my.id`)*\n- Simpan (*Save*).\n\n---\n\n#### 4. Atur Build / Start Command (Jika diminta)\nJika Dokploy meminta pengaturan build (biasanya menggunakan **Nixpacks**):\n- **Build Command**: `npx prisma generate && npx prisma db push && npm run build`\n- **Start Command**: `npm run start`\n\n---\n\n#### 5. Klik **Deploy** 🚀\n- Di pojok kanan atas, klik tombol **Deploy**.\n- Buka tab **Deployments** atau **Logs** untuk melihat prosesnya berjalan.\n- Tunggu sampai status berubah menjadi **Running / Healthy** (hijau).\n\nSetelah statusnya hijau, buka kembali:\n👉 **https://peserta39.m1sec.my.id**\n\nWeb CodeKids Anda akan langsung terbuka! Jika ada kendala saat deploy di Dokploy, bagian log mana yang muncul?","thinking":"A 502 Bad Gateway error suggests a problem with the application running within the Dokploy PaaS environment. The Dokploy dashboard is available at the provided domain. The likely cause of the error is the application failing to respond to requests or the container not running.\n\n\nDeployment failure or a misconfigured container port are the initial suspicions. The Next.js application likely defaults to a different port than the Dokploy configuration. Incomplete environment variable configuration, especially critical variables such as database connection string and API keys, are potential causes.\n\nFurther investigatio